name epsf-dvipdfmx
category Package
revision 35575
shortdesc Plain TeX file for using epsf.tex with (x)dvipdfmx
relocated 1
longdesc epsf-dvipdfmx.tex is a plain TeX file to be \input after
longdesc epsf.tex when using plain TeX with dvipdfmx. As in: \input epsf
longdesc \input epsf-dvipdfmx It is needed when an .eps file has
longdesc anything except the origin (0,0) for the lower-left of its
longdesc bounding box.
runfiles size=1
